  Placement: 0
  CardStory: "Something itches in the back of 2Spade head. He felt it today in the
    mess hall, a vague sense of wrongness. 2Spade hesitates. *Nothing was wrong.*
    Yes, it was. People are supposed to blink. \r\n\r\nHe has blinked today, multiple
    times. *I adjust the amount.* 2Spade asks 2Club about it, who sits in front of
    him, chewing while they speak. She blinks too, then opens her eyes wide at my
    question. She laughs. *I hadn\u2019t seen that facial positioning yet.* \r\n\r\n2Spade
    enjoys his talks with 2Club. *I take note of the chemicals involved.* She always
    knows what to say. She tells him about her day around a mouthful of stew. I learn
    a lot from 2Club. \r\n\r\nWhen they leave the mess hall together, 2Spade remembers
    to blink. *Blinking is important.* 2Club stops chewing. *Of course. Chewing is
    for when you\u2019re in the mess hall. But I am no longer there.*"
